# Scrape caches — large, regenerable, and full of third-party website text
# (a leaked Mapbox token from an operator's site once landed here and blocked a push).
# Keep them on disk for Pass B, but never version them.
#
# 2026-08-01: the single rule below only ever matched `pass_a_evidence_cache.json`, which is NOT
# the filename the sweep actually writes — so ~25 MB of scraped page text was tracked anyway.
# These are the real ones. NOTE: adding them here does not untrack what is already committed;
# see PASS_B_PREP_PLAN.md for the `git rm --cached` command.
supabase/seed/pass_a_evidence_cache.json
supabase/seed/sweep_pass_a_evidence.json
supabase/seed/quadtree_sweep_cache.json
supabase/seed/sweep_gate5_cache.json
supabase/seed/sweep_gate_results.json
supabase/seed/pass_b_inbox.txt

# Versioned on purpose (do NOT add these): sweep_pass_a_triage.json is the ledger, and
